  - m_Id: 108754519281115136
    m_Localized: "Bibliograf\xEDa general consultada en el estudio de correcci\xF3n,
      validaci\xF3n y adiciones al guion del tour virtual 360\xB0 al Palacio de Carondelet:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108754544929284096
    m_Localized: 'Yanapashkakuna:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108754609223770112
    m_Localized: "\xD1awpa Rimaykuna Arinishkakuna:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108754949654454272
    m_Localized: 'Rurashka:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126823099914526720
    m_Localized: "Usa el teclado para navegar \nPara desactivar el modo accesible
      presiona \u201CTab\u201D "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126823290252042240
    m_Localized: "Kay virtual purichiynaka willachinata, yachachinata kawsayta shinchiyachina
      kuska pankami kan, Carondelet wasipa kawsaykunatapash \xF1awpakawsaykunatapash
      shinchiyachinkapakpash riksichinkapakpashmi kan.\n\n<b>1. Virtual achikyachishkakuna
      maykamantak chayan</b>\nVirtual puriykunapash achikyachishkakunapash \xF1awpakawsay
      yachaykunawan, shuyukunawan, yachaksapa yuyaykunawanpashmi rurarishka kan.
      Chayta rikushpaka, tullpukuna, llakllashkakuna, achikkuna, hawalla rikuykuna,
      shukkunapash shuk tukushka rikuy usharinkami.\n\nKay achikyachishkakunaka \xF1awi
      \xF1awi rikukuk shina makiwan takarikuk shina mana pakta tukunkachu, shinallatak,
      mana shinapacha kanchu. Chaymantami, wakin rikuykunaka ashalla chikanmi kanka,
      wakinpika tukuymi shuklaya rikurinka, chayta rikushpaka.\n\n<b>2. \xD1awpa
      kawsay yuyaykunapash yachaykunapash</b>\nKay puriynakuypi kak rimaykunaka \xF1awpa
      kawsay yachaykunapipash kamukunapipashmi taripashkakunami kan, chaymantami,
      mutsurishka yuyaykunami kan.\n\nApukkunapa shuyukunata rikushpaka killkaykunami
      tiyan, chay killkaykunaka Sal\xF3n de los Presidentes ukupi imashina nikunmi,
      kan.\n\n<b>3. Akllashka yachaykunapash yanapaykunapash</b>\n\u201CD\xEDas de
      la Patria\u201D rikuchiytaka, Direcci\xF3n de Gesti\xF3n Documental y Archivo
      uku, Ministerio de Relaciones Exteriores y Movilidad Humana wasimi yanaparka.\n\nGabinete,
      Banquete, Oratorio ukukunapi tiyanakuk rikuchiykunaka, Reserva de Arte Colonial
      Republicano, Quito llaktamanta, Ministerio de Educaci\xF3n, Deporte y Cultura
      wasimantami kan.\n\nAshtawankarin, Banquete ukupi wakin rikuchiykunaka Alberto
      Mena Caama\xF1o, Centro Cultural Metropolitano de Quito wasimantami kan.\n\nKichwa
      shimiman killkashkaka Ecuador mamallaktapa shukllayachishka kichwa shimipimi
      kan. Bar\xF3n de Carondelet rimaykunaka Kichwa Otavalo rimaypimi kan. Ingl\xE9s
      shimipi, franc\xE9s shimipi uyariykunaka chay shimita rimakkunami yanaparka.\n\n<b>4.
      Llamkachun ima mutsurinakuna</b>\nKay virtual puriynakuypa 3D rikuypika llamkachunka
      ashatallapash hillay llamkaytami mutsun. Chaymantami wakin antakunapi all\xED
      llamkachunka, kaykunatallapash paktachinami:\n\n<b>Willi willi</b>\n\u2022
      Shina shinallapash, yallipash Smartphone willi willimi kana kan (kimsa-chusku
      wata washakaman)\n\u2022 RAM nishkaka 4GB nishkawanmi kana kan, yallipash.\n\u2022
      64GB wakaychik, yallipash.\n\u2022 Android 13, yallipash/iPhone, iOS 15 nishkawan,
      yallipash\n\u2022 Mushukyachishka navegador nishkawan (Chrome, Safari, shuk
      kakpika mushuk).\n\u2022 Internet nishkata charina, 4G, na kashpaka allipacha
      Wi-Fi.\n\n<b>Computadoras (PC o Mac)</b>\n\u2022 Mushukyachishka procesador
      nishkawan (Core i5 nishkalaya kakpipash Ryzen 5 bnishkalaywanpash, yallipash)\n\u2022
      16GB RAM\n\u2022 Disco s\xF3lido (SSD), 512 GB charikpipash, yallipipash.\n\u2022
      Windows 11, macOS Monterey (12) nishkapash, yallipash, na kashpaka mushukyachishka
      Linux.\n\u2022 Mushukyachishka navegador nishkawan (Chrome, Edge, Firefox,
      Safari).\n\u2022 Intnet nishkaman wankurishpaka allimi kana kan (Wi-Fi kakpipash
      ankuwan kakpipash).\n\n<b>Tablets</b>\n\u2022 Hatun rikuchik willi willika
      shina shinallapash kana, yallipash.\n\u2022 RAM nishkaka 4GB nishkatami charina,
      yallipash.\n\u2022 64GB wakaychinatami charina, yallitapash.\n\u2022 Android
      12+, iPadOS 15+, nishkakunata charina, na kashpaka shinalaya.\n\u2022 Taripana
      pankaka mushukyachishka kana kan.\n\u2022 Wi-Fi nishkaka allimi kana kan (LTE/5G
      tiyakpika)\n\nRikuypika (tullpu, rikuna, shukkunapash), chikan chikan antakunapi
      rikushpaka chikanmi rikurinka.\n\nMouse nishkawanmi yaykuchun ashtawan allimi
      kan, ninchik, shinami ashtawan allipacha yaykuypash llamkaypash usharinka.
      Makiwan antanikipi takarishpaka, wakinpika mana shinallatak rikurinkachu, takarinakuykunapi,
      antanikipa yachaykunapi, taripanakunapipash shuktakmi kay tukun.\n\n<b>5. Responsabilidad
      del usuario y limitaciones</b>\nPi runapash virtual purinakuyman yaykushpaka
      paypa makipimi ima rurashkapash sakirinka. Mana all\xED llamkakukpika kay wasika
      mana rikunkachu, shinallatak antakunapipash, taripanakunapipash, llikakunapipash
      mana all\xED llamkakukpipash, ashtawanpash kay pankata paskashka kakpi wakinpika
      imatapash wakllichikpika mana kay wasika imatapash rikunata charinchu.\n\n<b>6.
      Yuyayuk</b>\nVirtual purinakuypa yachaykunaka propiedad intelectual kamachiykunapimi
      wankurishka kan, shinallatak derechos de autor kamachiykunapipash. Kay llamkaytaka
      mana achikyachiytapash mirachiytapash usharinchu, ashtawanpash katunkapakpash
      imatapash rurankapakka shuk ma\xF1ayta arinishkata charina.\n\n<b>7. Kay yachaykunata
      mushukyachina</b>\nRikuchishka yachaykunaka \u2013killkaykuna, shuyukuna, rimaykuna,
      3D rikuykuna, pukllay rikuykuna- rikuchinkapakllami churashka kan, chaymanta
      mushukyachina, alliyachinapash mana willachishpa ruranallami kan.\n\nKay wasika
      kaypi rikuchishka willaykunamantaka mana shinapacha kay usdhan, willachinmi.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
